      ":question/problem": "![](images/b5/b58ea2476c51d685d063bd73849ec4c8b19c4c50192804659952a007ae5e8d35.png)\n\nConsider the following functions:\n\n$f(x, y) = (x + p, y + q), g(x, y) = (kx, ky)$\n\nThe function $f(x, y)$ is applied to $C$, and then $g(x, y)$ is applied to the result. The image of $C$ under this sequence of transformations is $C^{\u2032}$. What is $p + q + k$?"
